  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様\r\nひとりでの仕事をやってみて、どんな感じだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\n甜花……お芝居、ぜんぜん……できなかった……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……まぁ、あと何シーンかあるから、\r\n次はうまくいくといいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うーん……ひとりで仕事をするには、少し早かったかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん……\r\n甜花、アイドル向いてないの、かな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないよ。\r\nどうしたんだ、急に？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……みんなにいっぱい、迷惑かけてる……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花はまだ、変わり始めたところだろう\r\nもうちょっと頑張ってみないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃんたちや、プロデューサーさんは……\r\n甜花のこと、励ましてくれるけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なんで、甜花のこと……\r\n応援してくれるか……わかんない……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……いつも失敗しちゃうのに……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんな、甜花のことが好きだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "お仕事して……迷惑かけちゃっても……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "迷惑になんか思ってないさ\r\n失敗しても、その分以上に頑張ってくれるしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花も、頑張りたい……けど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "やっぱり、なんにもできない……\r\nみんなを、いっぱい困らせちゃう……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "アイドルって……みんな、すごいのに……\r\n甜花は全然……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "やっぱり、甜花にアイドルなんて……無理……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（甜花は自信を失くしてるな……\r\n何か声をかけてやらないと）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "甜花は磨けば\r\n光る子なんだ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "「何もできない」は\r\n嘘だな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "困らせたって\r\nいいじゃないか",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030160,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そんなことない……\r\n甜花……頑張っても、いいところなんて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はまだ、できないことがたくさんあるかもしれないけど、\r\n甜花には甜花だけの魅力があるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのことは、甜花をアイドルにした俺が保証するよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、ずっと甜花を見てきた甘奈に聞いてみても、\r\n同じことを言うと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花だけの魅力……そんなの、あるのかな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何か間違えて落ち込んでも、甜花は前を見続けるだろ？\r\nそれは、なかなかできることじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、それだけじゃないぞ\r\n甜花を見ていたくなる魅力が、たしかにあるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そうなの……？\r\n甜花……よくわかんない……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも……\r\n……ううん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030200,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "もう一度……\r\nが、頑張ってみるね……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030200"
  },
  {
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030210,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……嘘つきじゃないよ……\r\nお仕事……失敗ばっかりだし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？　\r\n甜花はダンスも歌もできてるじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030220,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そんなこと……\r\nなーちゃんたちに比べたら、全然……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでも、始めた頃に比べたら\r\nできるようになってきただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花なりに頑張ってるのを俺は見てきたし\r\n甜花は甜花のスピードで成長してる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのための努力だって、いっぱいしてるしな\r\nだからみんな応援したくなるし、甜花を見ていたくなるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030230,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "がんばるの、本当は苦手……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でもそう言ってくれるなら……\r\nもう少しだけ……諦めないで、頑張ってみる……ね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030250,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、ありがとう……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030250"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "困らせたっていいじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030260,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え……でも、甜花が困らせると……\r\nみんな、大変になっちゃう……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分にできないことを知ってるのはいいことだと思う\r\nでも、それで臆病になっちゃダメだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最初は誰だってうまくなんかできないけど\r\nそこで怖がっていたら、その先には進めないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずっと困らせるんじゃなくて今の間だけ……\r\nできるようになるまで、力を借りればいいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030270,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……そっか\r\n頼っても……いいんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030280,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……甜花、\r\nきっとひとりでも、頑張れるようになるから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030290,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "もうちょっとだけ……甜花のこと……\r\n見ててね……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001030300,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nじゃあ甜花、頑張ってくるね……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500103/1015001030300"
  },
